# Write-ups

Challenge walkthroughs organized by platform. Each write-up focuses on the
reasoning behind the solve, not just the steps.

## Platforms

| Platform | What's inside | Status |
|----------|---------------|--------|
| [Cylab Academy](./cylab-academy/) | Learning material and challenges from Cylab Academy | In progress |
| ↳ [picoCTF](./cylab-academy/picoctf/) | picoCTF challenges, grouped by category | In progress |
| [Other platforms](./other-platforms/) | Challenges from other CTF sites | Planned |

## What every write-up includes
Summary → Recon → Analysis → Exploitation → Flag (redacted) →
Root Cause & Mitigation → Takeaways → Tools Used

## Conventions
- File names: `challenge-name.md` (lowercase, hyphens)
- Flags are redacted as `CTF{...}`
- Active competition challenges are not published
- Each write-up links to the matching note in `../concepts/`
- Screenshots are cropped and kept in an `images/` folder next to the write-up

